# 📅 Week 4 – Monitoring with Prometheus

## Objective

Week 4 focused on monitoring the performance of the stream-processing system.

Prometheus was integrated into the StreamForge processor.

## Implemented Metrics

### 1. Events Processed

```text
streamforge_events_processed_total
```

Tracks the total number of telemetry events processed.

### 2. Processing Lag

```text
streamforge_processing_lag_seconds
```

Measures the difference between the event timestamp and processing time.

### 3. Events Per Second

```text
streamforge_events_per_second
```

Represents the current event-processing rate.

## Monitoring Endpoint

The metrics are exposed through:

```text
http://localhost:8000/metrics
```

## Monitoring Workflow

```text
Kafka Event
    ↓
Stream Processor
    ↓
Process Event
    ↓
Update Prometheus Metrics
    ↓
Metrics Endpoint
```

## Week 4 Result

The Prometheus monitoring server successfully exposed event count, processing lag, and events-per-second metrics while Kafka telemetry events were being processed.

