# 🔐 Fault Tolerance

StreamForge combines Kafka partitioning, RocksDB state persistence and Kafka changelog recovery to provide fault-tolerant stream processing.

If a worker fails, Kafka can rebalance the consumer group and redistribute partitions. When the worker restarts, previously stored state can be recovered and processing can continue.

---

# 📈 Monitoring

Prometheus provides visibility into the stream processor by monitoring:

* Total events processed
* Processing lag
* Events processed per second

This allows the performance of the distributed processing system to be observed during execution.

